  <name>exif-turbo</name>
  <summary>Fast EXIF full-text image search</summary>
  <metadata_license>MIT</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>
      exif-turbo is a cross-platform image EXIF metadata search and indexing tool.
      It scans image folders, extracts EXIF metadata, stores it in a local SQLite
      index, and provides fast full-text search over that data.
    </p>
